 land\, OR 97266\nWebsite: https://www.portland.gov/parks/portland-memory-g
 arden\nDetails: Therapeutic garden at Ed Benedict Park in outer SE Portlan
 d\, maintained with Friends of Portland Memory Garden. Added July 2026. St
 rong fit for low-energy\, anxiety-friendly\, accessible outdoor time.
