 ence & Bird Walks): Slough Science: Climate Resilience in Your Yard & Beyo
 nd
DESCRIPTION:Category: Parks & Nature\nCost: FREE\nInfo: Low-interaction pre
 sentation workshop with East Multnomah Soil & Water Conservation District 
 on soil\, water\, and native plants. Register on the event page.\nAddress:
  7040 NE 47th Ave\, Portland\, OR 97218\nPhone: 503-281-1132\nWebsite: htt
 ps://www.columbiaslough.org/events\nDetails: Free environmental education\
 , bird walks\, and watershed tours in North and Northeast Portland and Gre
 sham through Q1 2027.
LOCATION:Level Beer\, 5211 NE 148th Ave\, Portland\, OR 97230
URL:https://www.columbiaslough.org/events
CATEGORIES:Parks & Nature
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
